      "text": "A reporter asked me what are three of my core values. Here\u2019s what I said.\n\nVideo",
      "sourceUrl": "https://x.com/VivekGRamaswamy/status/2052857862607843711",
      "timestamp": "2026-05-08T21:07:09+00:00",
      "type": "tweet"
    },
    {
      "voiceId": "vivek-ramaswamy",
      "voiceName": "Vivek Ramaswamy",
      "platform": "x",
      "text": "There\u2019s a reason why trade unions have overwhelmingly endorsed me over my Democrat opponent. They rightfully want lower costs &amp; bigger paychecks and understand that I\u2019ll be able to deliver that in a way that Amy Acton just can\u2019t.\n\nVideo",
      "sourceUrl": "https://x.com/VivekGRamaswamy/status/2052846237351850302",
      "timestamp": "2026-05-08T20:20:57+00:00",
      "type": "tweet"
    },
    {
      "voiceId": "vivek-ramaswamy",
      "voiceName": "Vivek Ramaswamy",
      "platform": "x",
      "text": "We will always respect &amp; back our veterans. \ud83c\uddfa\ud83c\uddf8 \ud83c\uddfa\ud83c\uddf8\n\nVideo",
      "sourceUrl": "https://x.com/VivekGRamaswamy/status/2052837145988231277",
      "timestamp": "2026-05-08T19:44:50+00:00",
      "type": "tweet"
    },
    {
      "voiceId": "vivek-ramaswamy",
      "voiceName": "Vivek Ramaswamy",
      "platform": "x",
      "text": "Cut the waste, fraud, &amp; abuse in government handouts - and put that money back in the pockets of hardworking Ohioans.\n\nVideo",
      "sourceUrl": "https://x.com/VivekGRamaswamy/status/2052777738315104508",
      "timestamp": "2026-05-08T15:48:46+00:00",
      "type": "tweet"
    },
    {
      "voiceId": "vivek-ramaswamy",
      "voiceName": "Vivek Ramaswamy",
      "platform": "x",
      "text": "This is unacceptable &amp; will end when I\u2019m elected. We will prosecute the lawbreakers &amp; put the saved dollars back in the hands of Ohioans. It\u2019s shameful that socialist Amy Acton appears to condone this by ignoring it.\n\n\nLuke Rosiak (@lukerosiak)\n\nYou've heard about this story. Now you get to see it.\n\nI traveled to Columbus, Ohio, and witnessed the most egregious government waste I've seen in my 20 years as an investigative reporter.\n\nThis has been going on for years, and you've been payin",
      "sourceUrl": "https://x.com/VivekGRamaswamy/status/2052531230898614506",
      "timestamp": "2026-05-07T23:29:14+00:00",
      "type": "tweet"
    },
    {
      "voiceId": "vivek-ramaswamy",
      "voiceName": "Vivek Ramaswamy",
      "platform": "x",
      "text": "This is why we\u2019re doing it.\n\nVideo",
      "sourceUrl": "https://x.com/VivekGRamaswamy/status/2052475568998989955",
      "timestamp": "2026-05-07T19:48:03+00:00",
      "type": "tweet"
    },
    {
      "voiceId": "vivek-ramaswamy",
      "voiceName": "Vivek Ramaswamy",
      "platform": "x",
      "text": "Such an energetic 85-year-old man. Respect him immensely.\n\nVideo",
      "sourceUrl": "https://x.com/VivekGRamaswamy/status/2052434869322740162",
      "timestamp": "2026-05-07T17:06:19+00:00",
      "type": "tweet"
    },
    {
      "voiceId": "vivek-ramaswamy",
      "voiceName": "Vivek Ramaswamy",
      "platform": "x",
      "text": "Ohio Republicans are more united than ever. Now onwards to victory in November.\n\n\nEric Daugherty (@EricLDaugh)\n\n\ud83d\udea8 WOW! Vivek Ramaswamy wins 100% PERCENT of Ohio counties in the governor GOP primary \u2014 and with nearly all of the vote counted, he has 82.5% of the vote\n\nHis opponent didn\u2019t stand a CHANCE! \ud83d\udc4f\ud83c\udffb \n\nTime to keep Ohio red \ud83d\udd25\n\nVideo\n  \n\n\n\n\n\n\u2014 https://nitter.net/EricLDaugh/status/2051984837725024663#m",
      "sourceUrl": "https://x.com/VivekGRamaswamy/status/2052414374690934928",
      "timestamp": "2026-05-07T15:44:53+00:00",
      "type": "tweet"
    },
    {
      "voiceId": "vivek-ramaswamy",
      "voiceName": "Vivek Ramaswamy",
      "platform": "x",
      "text": "We say no to socialism in Ohio.\n\nVideo",
      "sourceUrl": "https://x.com/VivekGRamaswamy/status/2052387635604373899",
      "timestamp": "2026-05-07T13:58:38+00:00",
      "type": "tweet"
    },
    {
      "voiceId": "vivek-ramaswamy",
      "voiceName": "Vivek Ramaswamy",
      "platform": "x",
      "text": "Lower costs. Bigger paychecks. Better schools.\n\nVideo",
      "sourceUrl": "https://x.com/VivekGRamaswamy/status/2052387424626696311",
      "timestamp": "2026-05-07T13:57:48+00:00",
      "type": "tweet"
    },
    {
      "voiceId": "vivek-ramaswamy",
      "voiceName": "Vivek Ramaswamy",
      "platform": "x",
      "text": "Ohio has over 2,000 taxing authorities, that\u2019s way too many layers of government. We\u2019re going to shrink bureaucracy, cut red tape, and put that $$ back in your pockets.\n\nVideo",
      "sourceUrl": "https://x.com/VivekGRamaswamy/status/2052228002881458272",
      "timestamp": "2026-05-07T03:24:19+00:00",
      "type": "tweet"
    },
    {
      "voiceId": "vivek-ramaswamy",
      "voiceName": "Vivek Ramaswamy",
      "platform": "x",
      "text": "One of Ohio\u2019s greatest challenges is our declining population. Here\u2019s how we\u2019re going to turn it around &amp; bring an economic boom back to our state.\n\nVideo",
      "sourceUrl": "https://x.com/VivekGRamaswamy/status/2052208130973725137",
      "timestamp": "2026-05-07T02:05:21+00:00",
      "type": "tweet"
    },
    {
      "voiceId": "vivek-ramaswamy",
      "voiceName": "Vivek Ramaswamy",
      "platform": "x",
      "text": "We\u2019re fully behind the farmers of our state &amp; they will thrive once again after we win in November.\n\nVideo",
      "sourceUrl": "https://x.com/VivekGRamaswamy/status/2052095822347841786",
      "timestamp": "2026-05-06T18:39:04+00:00",
      "type": "tweet"
    },
    {
      "voiceId": "vivek-ramaswamy",
      "voiceName": "Vivek Ramaswamy",
      "platform": "x",
      "text": "\ud83d\udcaa\ud83c\udffc \ud83d\udcaa\ud83c\udffc\n\n\nFox News (@FoxNews)\n\nThe red map paints a clear picture as Vivek Ramaswamy wins every county in Ohio during the state\u2019s GOP gubernatorial primary.\n\nRamaswamy swept the state from corner to corner and says he wants everyone in Ohio to experience the blessings his family has had:\n\n\u201cMy faith teaches me that we have a moral duty to use those blessings, to use these gifts that we've been given, to leave this state and this country better than we found it.\u201d\n\nVideo\n  \n\n\n\n\n\n\u2014 https://nitter.net/",
      "sourceUrl": "https://x.com/VivekGRamaswamy/status/2052034332802646374",
      "timestamp": "2026-05-06T14:34:44+00:00",
      "type": "tweet"
    },
    {
      "voiceId": "vivek-ramaswamy",
      "voiceName": "Vivek Ramaswamy",
      "platform": "x",
      "text": "My message to Democrats &amp; Independents: if you care about giving your kids the same shot at the American Dream that this state gave to me, we will work with you to lead our state to greater heights than ever. \ud83d\ude4f\n\nVideo",
      "sourceUrl": "https://x.com/VivekGRamaswamy/status/2052033678629572649",
      "timestamp": "2026-05-06T14:32:08+00:00",
      "type": "tweet"
    },
    {
      "voiceId": "vivek-ramaswamy",
      "voiceName": "Vivek Ramaswamy",
      "platform": "x",
      "text": "A world-class education is the birthright of every Ohioan &amp; we\u2019ll make sure that\u2019s what they get, from the inner cities to Appalachia.\n\nVideo",
      "sourceUrl": "https://x.com/VivekGRamaswamy/status/2051859531999977857",
      "timestamp": "2026-05-06T03:00:08+00:00",
      "type": "tweet"
